At the time, I had a chameleon as a pet. I didn't even realize it was a
chameleon until my newly-tamed pet large cat suddenly turned into a kobold
zombie, then an acid blob, then other things (including a purple worm
which ate a shopkeeper for me). It was great fun until it turned into a
freezing sphere and exploded :( <sigh>.
